<title>JAPAN: Ichiyoshi Sec says clients file complaint.</title>
<headline>Ichiyoshi Sec says clients file complaint.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ichiyoshi Securities Co Ltd said on Thursday that a group of its clients had filed a complaint in court against the medium-sized brokerage.</p>
<p>Ichiyoshi said in a statement the clients alleged they had suffered losses from margin trading in securities conducted since 1992. The clients are asking for compensation worth 8.10 billion yen, it said.</p>
<p>However, the firm said it rejected the complaint and would contest it in court.</p>
<p>An official at the company declined to give further details.</p>
</text>
